<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan to auction federal investment bonds.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to auction federal investment bonds.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan on Tuesday invited bids by Thursday for three-, five- and 10-year federal investment bonds.</p>
<p>The result of the auction will be announced on Friday and settlement will be on Monday, the bank said.</p>
<p>In the previous auction held on February 23, the bank accepted bids worth 150.2 million rupees at par for three-year bonds and 90 million rupees at par for 10-year bonds. No bids were received for the five-year bonds.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
